#174744=PRODUCT('PRT - 9037 - CAMTARXIA - V04',
'PRT - 9037 - CAMTARXIA - V04',
'Beam target for the XIAO ESP32-S3 Sense, chassis: slides into an open
UC2 cube, two rigid rails on -x seat on the 45 deg edge chamfers (x, z
); two long flexure arms on +x press on the throat walls, two lands on
 -x limit the roll. Camera block in a square seat, XIAO from the back,
 USB-C from the top. PETG, print on the front face, no supports.',(#174739));
#174745=PRODUCT('PRT - 9038 - CAMTARCOV - V04',
'PRT - 9038 - CAMTARCOV - V04',
'Back cover: slides down in the dovetail, tongues press the XIAO forwa
rd, the slits are the vents. One M3 x 10 into a Ruthex insert. Print o
n the back face.',(#174739));
#174746=PRODUCT('PRT - 9033 - CAMTARKEY - V04',
'PRT - 9033 - CAMTARKEY - V04',
'Wedge key: pushed in from the side between the camera module and the 
USB-C shell, clamps the module into its seat. Print on its side.',(#174739));
#174747=PRODUCT('PRT - 9034 - CAMTARSCR - V04',
'PRT - 9034 - CAMTARSCR - V04',
'Screen cap: 0.6 mm printed white screen with a reticle on the inner f
ace, cone-centred, two 8x3 magnets. Print on the screen, white.',(#174739));
